# TIN TROOP 2-C, start to finish with plain button presses (recorded once
# from a route plan). A stone dropped down the hole puts out the candles
# at its foot and makes a step; a Pop clears the soap bars in the corridor
# (the pill bugs go off on their own); two stones, each half off the edge
# of the one below, make a stair up to the high ledge.
game tintroop
wait 5
cheat unlock
press A
wait 5
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press A
wait 30
press A
wait 5
wait 66
hold RIGHT 169
hold RIGHT+A 18
hold DOWN+B 2
wait 130
hold RIGHT 130
wait 3
hold RIGHT 95
hold UP+B 2
wait 109
hold RIGHT 24
wait 2
hold RIGHT 358
hold DOWN+B 2
wait 58
hold RIGHT 83
wait 1
hold RIGHT 26
hold RIGHT+A 12
wait 15
hold DOWN+B 2
wait 58
hold RIGHT 77
wait 1
hold RIGHT 25
hold RIGHT+A 12
wait 9
hold RIGHT+A 10
wait 8
hold RIGHT+A 32
hold RIGHT 493
expect state == 4
expect best_5 == 16
expect goals & 1
